OL,3,ARubio turns to small Indian town as US
OL,4,Afaces high oil prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe western Indian port town of
OL,7,FJamnagar is not a usual stop for
OL,8,Fforeign leaders, yet it featured
OL,9,Fprominently in US Secretary of State
OL,10,FMarco Rubio's recent visit.
OL,12,FSo, why did Rubio visit the town? And,
OL,13,Fmore importantly, why did he skip the
OL,14,FIndian capital, Delhi?
OL,16,FThe answer to both questions may have
OL,17,Fless to do with India and more to do
OL,18,Fwith Donald Trump administration's
OL,19,Fdomestic compulsions ` or, more
OL,20,Fprecisely, its domestic oil needs.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
