OL,3,ARubio turns to small Indian town as US
OL,4,Afaces high oil prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FRubio arrived in the financial capital
OL,7,FMumbai on Tuesday, where he met Indian
OL,8,FForeign Minister S Jaishankar and some
OL,9,Fof the country's top business leaders.
OL,10,FHe officially ended his trip in
OL,11,FJamnagar - in the western state of
OL,12,FGujarat - home to the giant oil
OL,13,Frefinery owned by one of Asia's richest
OL,14,Fmen, Mukesh Ambani.
